    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself drops to 0 Hit Points, you can take a Reaction to instill it with a final act of aggression. The creature immediately makes one weapon attack against a creature of your choice within its reach.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> Before the attack, you can move the cursed creature up to half its Speed, and you grant a bonus to its attack roll equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of +1).</p>",
